olicy. Note anything the page does not state.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11.5px;color:#64748B;margin-top:8px;&quot;&gt;Done when every cell is filled or marked as not stated.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=7;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E2E8F0;strokeWidth=1.5;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="452" y="644" width="418" height="168" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

